User: In the diagram, two circles, each with center $D$, have radii of $1$ and $2$. The total area of the shaded region is $\frac5{12}$ of the area of the larger circle. How many degrees are in the measure of (the smaller) $\angle ADC$?
[asy]
size(4cm);
defaultpen(linewidth(0.75));
real adc = 100;
pair d = (0, 0); pair a = 2 * dir(100); pair c = (2, 0);
path inner = arc(d, a/2, c/2, CW);

path outer = arc(d, c, a, CCW);
guide region1 = (a--a/2)..inner..(c/2--c)..outer..cycle;
